1
00:01:41,199 --> 00:02:03,199
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:04,039 --> 00:02:08,459
No living creature was hurt during
the production of this show.

3
00:02:09,267 --> 00:02:11,767
Can I leave?

4
00:02:14,916 --> 00:02:16,676
Alps!

5
00:02:19,218 --> 00:02:21,478
Let him go.

6
00:03:09,994 --> 00:03:12,514
Why did you let him Osman Bey?

7
00:03:12,847 --> 00:03:16,877
You should have let me tear him down and
give his bones to the dogs!

8
00:03:17,012 --> 00:03:21,532
Umur Bey, I didn't want the son to
suffer from...

9
00:03:22,601 --> 00:03:24,891
his father's mistakes.

10
00:03:26,187 --> 00:03:31,077
Come to my tent.
I need to talk to you.

11
00:03:46,768 --> 00:03:49,278
Aris the Lord.

12
00:03:52,230 --> 00:03:55,130
Don't upset yourself.

13
00:03:57,450 --> 00:04:00,500
You are going to be useful for the first
time in your life.

14
00:04:02,391 --> 00:04:03,701
Take him out.

15
00:04:34,846 --> 00:04:36,606
Umur Bey...

16
00:04:37,302 --> 00:04:43,279
How can you, who is such a smart man,
fall into carelessness...

17
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:46,669
and send Malhun Hatun to Lord Nicola?

18
00:04:47,127 --> 00:04:50,257
Don't you know we have hostiles?

19
00:04:50,345 --> 00:04:54,869
I sent my daughter as a messenger to tell
him to hand Togay over us.

20
00:04:54,869 --> 00:04:59,529
Umur Bey! How can you ignore us?

21
00:05:00,517 --> 00:05:03,457
Are we talking about ignoring?

22
00:05:03,628 --> 00:05:06,858
On which subject did you actually
consulted us?

23
00:05:06,858 --> 00:05:09,668
And you say I am the one who
ignores you?

24
00:05:12,094 --> 00:05:17,394
You made me do this Osman Bey.
If you had found that Togay dog...

25
00:05:17,984 --> 00:05:20,505
I wouldn't have done this.

26
00:05:20,505 --> 00:05:22,235
Umur Bey!

27
00:05:22,377 --> 00:05:25,357
I told you to know your limits!

28
00:05:25,888 --> 00:05:28,428
But you never listened to me.

29
00:05:28,883 --> 00:05:31,613
This is my last warning.

30
00:05:32,513 --> 00:05:36,283
Do not act before asking me ever again!

31
00:05:41,307 --> 00:05:45,297
What is your decision, Osman Bey?
Tell me now.

32
00:05:47,586 --> 00:05:49,876
I'll gather Beys.

33
00:05:54,398 --> 00:05:56,888
Then I'll decide.

34
00:06:23,498 --> 00:06:26,868
What happened to her?
Is she dead?

35
00:06:29,162 --> 00:06:31,132
Ssshh! Stand up!

36
00:06:35,808 --> 00:06:37,658
Stand up!

37
00:06:52,764 --> 00:06:55,364
I'm talking to you!
Stand up!

38
00:07:39,205 --> 00:07:42,525
There must be something wrong.

39
00:07:46,968 --> 00:07:50,578
Go to the tent. Let our Bey know.

40
00:08:02,990 --> 00:08:06,430
Deliver your swords to us.
We'll take you to the castle.

41
00:09:05,204 --> 00:09:07,554
Throw your sword away.

42
00:09:07,670 --> 00:09:09,980
Or I'll kill them.

43
00:09:13,777 --> 00:09:15,877
I told you to throw it!

44
00:09:23,286 --> 00:09:25,236
Take them!

45
00:09:26,512 --> 00:09:29,089
- Quickly!
- Let go of me.

46
00:09:30,599 --> 00:09:32,139
Let go of me.

47
00:09:46,644 --> 00:09:49,924
We can't let the infidels take
Malhun Hatun away, Osman Bey.

48
00:09:50,501 --> 00:09:53,771
I propose that we give the Lord,
take Malhun Hatun.

49
00:09:56,129 --> 00:10:00,762
We need to meet Nicola andfind out
if Malhun Hatun alive or not...

50
00:10:00,762 --> 00:10:07,932
Then, if we can find a way to take Malhun
Hatun back without giving the Lord away...

51
00:10:07,932 --> 00:10:10,235
we shall attack.

52
00:10:13,135 --> 00:10:18,315
Osman Bey, I'm afraid Nicola is going to
predict the same thing.

53
00:10:18,885 --> 00:10:23,645
He'll want the Lord but he won't give
Malhun Hatun to us.

54
00:10:25,204 --> 00:10:29,796
Swap is dangerous, Osman Bey.

55
00:10:29,796 --> 00:10:33,926
We have to trick them.

56
00:10:39,507 --> 00:10:41,887
Do you hear it Umur Bey?

57
00:10:44,083 --> 00:10:48,863
I'll make a move to make
all these right.

58
00:10:51,143 --> 00:10:53,673
What is your intention, Osman Bey?

59
00:10:55,510 --> 00:10:57,570
What are you thinking of?

60
00:11:02,287 --> 00:11:08,057
Umur Bey, you shall be our guest
a little more time.

61
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:14,613
Rest in your tent.
We are handling this.

62
00:11:14,613 --> 00:11:17,863
Osman Bey, this is not the time to rest.

63
00:11:22,628 --> 00:11:24,988
I'll come to the swap area, too.

64
00:11:24,993 --> 00:11:27,723
You cannot object.

65
00:11:30,216 --> 00:11:33,086
You have to obey, Umur Bey!

66
00:11:35,333 --> 00:11:39,283
The daughter is mine,
the issue is mine

67
00:11:41,934 --> 00:11:44,644
You can't do it without me!

68
00:11:45,313 --> 00:11:49,933
You are going to see how we do it!

69
00:12:00,133 --> 00:12:05,643
Your obligatory behaviour won't
bring peaceful friendship Osman Bey.

70
00:12:11,997 --> 00:12:16,917
Be a friend to us.
Stay friendly.

71
00:12:17,984 --> 00:12:22,594
The contrary won't work for you Umur Bey.

72
00:12:32,284 --> 00:12:34,414
Alps!

73
00:12:45,267 --> 00:12:47,817
Take Umur Bey to his tent.

74
00:13:17,531 --> 00:13:22,641
Obviously, Nicola will try to trick us.

75
00:13:25,517 --> 00:13:28,217
But I am going to trick him.

76
00:13:30,922 --> 00:13:37,876
I'll go to the swap area
early with my alps, deploy there.

77
00:13:40,846 --> 00:13:43,696
And Nicola won't know it.

78
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:49,580
And the other Alps will bring the Lord.

79
00:13:50,122 --> 00:13:54,412
If Nicola tries something...

80
00:13:55,198 --> 00:14:01,428
then I'll cut his head off in the field!

81
00:14:08,580 --> 00:14:13,500
Let's go!
We shall hurry up!

82
00:15:37,414 --> 00:15:39,414
What do you want?

83
00:15:39,836 --> 00:15:44,146
You took too many lives, you shed blood.

84
00:15:44,985 --> 00:15:47,145
That's what I heard.

85
00:15:51,671 --> 00:15:53,871
I've brought you food.

86
00:15:54,682 --> 00:16:02,032
Eat so that you can rouse yourself,
Malhun Hatun.

87
00:16:02,372 --> 00:16:04,594
Only one of us is going to
get out of here!

88
00:16:05,139 --> 00:16:07,089
You know that!

89
00:16:09,287 --> 00:16:16,287
You are bad at predictions.

90
00:16:20,450 --> 00:16:25,220
Eat.
Eat so that...

91
00:16:26,202 --> 00:16:29,952
you can arrive at your tent.

92
00:16:31,687 --> 00:16:34,187
What are you trying to say, Togay?

93
00:16:37,059 --> 00:16:39,979
I'm not afraid of you, Togay!

94
00:16:45,056 --> 00:16:49,056
Such a girl wouldn't be afraid, yes.

95
00:16:51,371 --> 00:16:56,831
Your courage gives me power.

96
00:16:57,959 --> 00:16:59,769
Malhun.

97
00:17:05,734 --> 00:17:09,714
Burn in hell, Togay!
Burn in hell!

98
00:17:10,349 --> 00:17:14,549
Hell, the place where Togay breathes in.

99
00:17:15,982 --> 00:17:19,852
-What does this ignoble want Malhun Hatun?
-We'll see, Alaca.

100
00:17:21,236 --> 00:17:22,926
We'll see.

101
00:17:49,812 --> 00:17:52,122
You are worried.

102
00:17:53,261 --> 00:17:55,581
What makes you, my Bey?

103
00:17:55,781 --> 00:18:00,701
I am not worried.
I am angry, my Bala.

104
00:18:01,473 --> 00:18:04,543
Are you angry because Malhun Hatun
is captured?

105
00:18:22,509 --> 00:18:25,229
What is my purpose, Bala?

106
00:18:29,216 --> 00:18:31,326
Tell me.

107
00:18:32,181 --> 00:18:34,721
What is my purpose?

108
00:18:38,866 --> 00:18:43,496
What have I been saying since
I conquered Kulucahisar.

109
00:18:47,679 --> 00:18:50,169
- Inegol, you say.
- Yes.

110
00:18:53,371 --> 00:18:55,431
I am talking about Inegol.

111
00:18:55,651 --> 00:18:57,491
I'm talking about Bursa.

112
00:18:58,779 --> 00:19:00,689
I'm talking about a state.

113
00:19:03,008 --> 00:19:04,848
But...

114
00:19:07,441 --> 00:19:09,541
What are my enemies doing?

115
00:19:13,975 --> 00:19:16,897
They hamper you, my Osman.

116
00:19:16,897 --> 00:19:20,357
Of course they do!
They are the enemy.

117
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:30,130
What about my friends?

118
00:19:35,882 --> 00:19:38,242
They don't stand with you.

119
00:19:39,169 --> 00:19:41,729
They are not with you.

120
00:19:44,964 --> 00:19:49,044
- They retard the conquer.
- This is why I am angry!

121
00:19:49,963 --> 00:19:53,093
This is why I'm eating my heart out, Bala!

122
00:20:18,616 --> 00:20:21,946
However, however you...

123
00:20:24,145 --> 00:20:26,455
you are not like them.

124
00:20:28,792 --> 00:20:31,662
You stand with me like a mountain.

125
00:20:37,197 --> 00:20:40,777
I always will, my Osman.
Always.

126
00:22:15,373 --> 00:22:18,913
The Lord has been shot!
Protect the Lord!

127
00:22:22,316 --> 00:22:25,996
Protect the Lord!
Protect the Lord!

128
00:22:31,670 --> 00:22:33,780
Alps get in order!

129
00:23:02,869 --> 00:23:08,579
Hold on Aris! Set a fire at once!
We'll brand the wound!

130
00:23:09,679 --> 00:23:11,299
Come on!

131
00:23:19,038 --> 00:23:21,618
Hold on Aris!

132
00:23:21,795 --> 00:23:24,165
We can't let him die!

133
00:23:26,950 --> 00:23:30,260
Hold on Aris! Hold on!

134
00:23:32,740 --> 00:23:34,350
He will die.

135
00:23:38,884 --> 00:23:41,994
Who did this Cerkutay, who?

136
00:23:42,129 --> 00:23:47,219
An arrow which finds its target doesn't
only kill one, also sheds others' blood!

137
00:23:47,281 --> 00:23:49,881
That kind of arrow this is.

138
00:24:02,223 --> 00:24:04,273
What are we going to say to our Bey now?

139
00:24:05,143 --> 00:24:07,883
May Allah save us from our Bey's wrath.

140
00:24:24,904 --> 00:24:30,524
When we are sure we have Malhun Hatun,
we'll move with my sign.

141
00:24:32,369 --> 00:24:34,489
This will be done today.

142
00:24:39,706 --> 00:24:40,936
My Bey.

143
00:24:44,590 --> 00:24:46,270
The Lord...

144
00:24:46,709 --> 00:24:49,599
- Yes?
- They killed the Lord on the way.

145
00:26:40,021 --> 00:26:42,321
My Bey, we were on the way...

146
00:27:03,927 --> 00:27:06,617
Who did this Osman Bey?

147
00:27:11,249 --> 00:27:13,169
Who, if not Nicola?

148
00:27:14,577 --> 00:27:20,927
I'd say Togay but he is cooperating
with Nicola.

149
00:27:37,149 --> 00:27:38,919
Nicola is coming my Bey.

150
00:29:25,657 --> 00:29:28,917
Where is the Lord, Osman Bey?

151
00:29:37,524 --> 00:29:40,104
They killed the Lord on the way.

152
00:29:50,463 --> 00:29:52,433
Bring him!

153
00:30:15,970 --> 00:30:20,550
Who did this?
If not you, who?

154
00:30:35,095 --> 00:30:38,215
They are trying to set a game on us!

155
00:30:39,516 --> 00:30:42,326
Give Malhun Hatun to me now!

156
00:30:42,350 --> 00:30:45,270
We'll do whatever we do
in the battlefield.

157
00:30:45,344 --> 00:30:49,164
Go to hell, Osman Bey!

158
00:30:49,289 --> 00:30:51,479
Alps!

159
00:30:53,125 --> 00:30:55,805
The captives...

160
00:30:57,797 --> 00:30:59,937
are still mine.

161
00:31:46,338 --> 00:31:51,708
Fall back now!
I'll make you pay for my Lord.

162
00:31:54,758 --> 00:31:58,228
You'll hear about Malhun Hatun later.

163
00:32:07,940 --> 00:32:10,150
What are we going to do, Osman Bey?

164
00:32:21,337 --> 00:32:23,967
Let them go.

165
00:32:31,175 --> 00:32:33,315
Soldier!

166
00:34:12,257 --> 00:34:17,227
Everything goes alright, in sha Allah.
They take Malhun Hatun, give the Lord.

167
00:34:17,705 --> 00:34:19,495
In sha Allah, my Bala.

168
00:34:20,459 --> 00:34:22,969
In sha Allah.

169
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:26,730
Our alps shall come back safe and soud.

170
00:34:27,031 --> 00:34:28,901
In sha Allah.

171
00:34:33,702 --> 00:34:36,722
Then we are going to work on
the main point.

172
00:34:40,281 --> 00:34:43,031
What is the main point, my Bala?

173
00:34:43,398 --> 00:34:48,538
You tell me, Gonca. What are you thinking
about that makes you miss my words?

174
00:34:50,004 --> 00:34:52,034
No way, my Bala.

175
00:34:52,452 --> 00:34:57,702
I have been trying to chat here. You only
say in sha Allah.

176
00:34:57,972 --> 00:35:02,322
We shall be done with it so
you start hearing again.

177
00:35:03,285 --> 00:35:04,875
What is it, Bala?

178
00:35:06,238 --> 00:35:09,908
What do you think it is, my Gonca?
I'm talking about the wedding.

179
00:35:14,848 --> 00:35:20,028
Come on, Bala. This wasn't the only thing
I was thinking about.

180
00:35:22,436 --> 00:35:24,686
I think it was, Gonca.

181
00:35:25,946 --> 00:35:31,986
Don't worry. I'll remind Osman Bey
when he returns.

182
00:35:34,877 --> 00:35:37,417
Whatever you say, my Bala.

183
00:35:37,743 --> 00:35:39,813
You know the best.

184
00:35:47,863 --> 00:35:50,273
Who did this?
Who?!

185
00:35:52,845 --> 00:35:55,055
Who did this?

186
00:36:00,549 --> 00:36:05,339
My dignity vanished while I was
trying to end Osman's.

187
00:36:06,095 --> 00:36:09,705
Now all the Lord will doubt my power.

188
00:36:11,801 --> 00:36:14,631
This is way better.

189
00:36:14,711 --> 00:36:16,721
So much better.

190
00:36:17,011 --> 00:36:24,241
The Lords will come under your security.
They'll run away from Osman's wrath.

191
00:36:25,479 --> 00:36:29,489
You... you did it.

192
00:36:35,250 --> 00:36:41,280
Who else could dare to do that?

193
00:36:43,521 --> 00:36:47,111
Umur Bey couldn't protect the captive.

194
00:36:47,211 --> 00:36:53,211
He couldn't save his daughter.

195
00:36:54,918 --> 00:37:01,318
Umur Bey was shot in Osman's meeting.
Now his daughter is captived by us.

196
00:37:03,808 --> 00:37:11,538
When you attack Sogut, Umur Bey won't
fight for Osman.

197
00:37:15,457 --> 00:37:24,197
I know Umur Bey very well. He won't
fight for Osman Bey.

198
00:37:27,438 --> 00:37:32,608
Without notifying me, do not...

199
00:37:34,887 --> 00:37:36,457
Sir.

200
00:37:41,466 --> 00:37:43,546
We have to talk.

201
00:37:45,120 --> 00:37:49,840
The fat is in the fire. Think about the
opportunuties...

202
00:37:50,451 --> 00:37:52,621
I've created for you, Nicola.

203
00:38:04,941 --> 00:38:07,451
What is it Helen?

204
00:38:07,695 --> 00:38:10,665
I have good news for you.

205
00:38:19,597 --> 00:38:22,687
Where is my daughter, Osman Bey?
Did you get her?

206
00:38:28,330 --> 00:38:31,650
The Lord was assassinated.

207
00:38:33,387 --> 00:38:34,587
What?

208
00:38:39,028 --> 00:38:40,628
He died.

209
00:38:43,539 --> 00:38:45,309
What about my daughter?

210
00:38:47,070 --> 00:38:49,720
She's in Nicola's hands.

211
00:38:51,103 --> 00:38:55,523
You didn't take me there.

212
00:38:55,667 --> 00:38:59,316
So I wouldn't act by myself,
huh Osman Bey?

213
00:38:59,316 --> 00:39:02,166
Because it'd cost me dearly,
right Osman Bey?

214
00:39:02,638 --> 00:39:05,928
Well this is the worst scenario Osman Bey!

215
00:39:07,871 --> 00:39:15,441
Nicola will kill my daughter now that
the Lord is dead.

216
00:39:17,435 --> 00:39:19,945
Nicola is not involved in this.

217
00:39:20,804 --> 00:39:27,764
We have to know who is doing what
right now.

218
00:39:29,219 --> 00:39:38,099
Osman Bey, this obligatory visit must end.
I must return to my tent.

219
00:39:38,294 --> 00:39:44,214
We'll take care of ourselves from now on.

220
00:39:47,116 --> 00:39:49,186
Can I come in my Bey?

221
00:39:50,992 --> 00:39:52,932
Come.

222
00:40:11,949 --> 00:40:15,879
Malhun Hatun will be in Nicola's
hunting ground.

223
00:40:36,622 --> 00:40:39,142
Your visit will end.

224
00:40:40,078 --> 00:40:45,098
But you cannot act by yourself.

225
00:40:50,578 --> 00:40:52,288
Alps.

226
00:41:50,913 --> 00:41:52,463
Untie her.

227
00:41:52,845 --> 00:41:56,505
Where? Where?

228
00:41:57,198 --> 00:42:00,697
Where are you taking her?

229
00:42:00,697 --> 00:42:03,660
- Let go of her!
- Let go of me!

230
00:42:04,050 --> 00:42:08,530
- Let go of me!
- My Hanım!

231
00:42:21,239 --> 00:42:23,319
Can I come in my Bey?

232
00:42:24,716 --> 00:42:26,736
Come brother.

233
00:42:30,613 --> 00:42:32,633
Eyvallah (thank you) brother.

234
00:42:32,726 --> 00:42:35,436
Get Alps ready, brother.

235
00:42:36,414 --> 00:42:38,684
We have news from Inegol.

236
00:42:39,247 --> 00:42:43,657
Nicola will take Malhun Hatun to
Ala Forest.

237
00:42:44,031 --> 00:42:46,291
Why is he doing that, Osman Bey?

238
00:42:46,780 --> 00:42:50,870
We'll see brother, we'll see.

239
00:42:53,092 --> 00:42:58,452
He still suspects the spy in the castle.

240
00:42:59,980 --> 00:43:03,240
So he didn't want to leave
Malhun Hatun alone.

241
00:43:03,995 --> 00:43:09,495
He will take precautions on the way.

242
00:43:09,948 --> 00:43:11,991
There will be lots of soldiers.

243
00:43:11,991 --> 00:43:17,305
Don't worry, Osman Bey. Our Alps
pant for fight.

244
00:43:17,305 --> 00:43:22,155
We'll set off at dawn. We'll take Malhun
Hatun and head back.

245
00:43:22,874 --> 00:43:25,014
As you command, Osman Bey.

246
00:43:25,069 --> 00:43:27,049
Eyvallah (thank you) brother.

247
00:43:51,102 --> 00:43:56,512
Zulfikar was right. That woman called
Malhun must be inside.

248
00:43:56,989 --> 00:43:59,869
Look, she is all silent.

249
00:43:59,959 --> 00:44:02,109
She got what she deserved.

250
00:44:05,920 --> 00:44:08,860
You love Malhun Hatun, right?

251
00:44:10,181 --> 00:44:13,731
I'm fond of her. You?

252
00:44:16,278 --> 00:44:18,508
She is totally a daughter of a Bey.

253
00:44:20,623 --> 00:44:22,433
You are crazy.

254
00:44:23,150 --> 00:44:27,100
Let's go back.
We have to notify Osman Bey.

255
00:44:35,749 --> 00:44:40,259
Even if we take Malhun Hatun back, I'm
afraid she and her dad will cause trouble.

256
00:44:42,187 --> 00:44:45,577
We've always been troubled since they
joined us, Osman Bey.

257
00:44:47,118 --> 00:44:52,178
Togay was after Umur Bey, now us.

258
00:44:55,776 --> 00:45:01,704
We are just getting started, brother. All
the problems of communities which...

259
00:45:01,704 --> 00:45:06,574
we invited to join us
will be our problems, too.

260
00:45:08,005 --> 00:45:11,245
They are just thinking of themselves.

261
00:45:13,276 --> 00:45:17,496
It's not easy to manage all those
Beys and alps Osman Bey.

262
00:45:21,113 --> 00:45:24,333
As long as Turkish tents don't unite...

263
00:45:24,956 --> 00:45:32,536
There will always be Mongols, Byzantines
and others on our lands.

264
00:45:46,863 --> 00:45:50,813
- Zülfükar's was right.
- Eyvallah.

265
00:45:51,097 --> 00:45:56,207
Guardians are keeping watch, my Bey.
Malhun Hatun is inside.

266
00:45:56,214 --> 00:45:59,424
- How many are there?
- Four, my Bey.

267
00:46:01,140 --> 00:46:06,710
Two more must be there. According to the
horseshoe tracks, they are six or seven.

268
00:46:09,855 --> 00:46:11,625
Now listen to me carefully.

269
00:46:48,135 --> 00:46:50,285
Be careful.

270
00:48:26,489 --> 00:48:28,169
Malhun Hatun.

271
00:48:43,554 --> 00:48:45,564
Malhun Hatun.

272
00:48:57,786 --> 00:48:59,746
Zülfikar.

273
00:49:01,406 --> 00:49:03,266
Zülfikar.

274
00:49:11,188 --> 00:49:13,198
My valiant.

275
00:49:31,820 --> 00:49:33,180
Come on.

276
00:51:17,333 --> 00:51:19,023
They are getting closer.

277
00:51:33,033 --> 00:51:38,413
Inna Lillahi wa inna ilayhi raji'un
"Verily we belong to Allah,
and verily to Him do we return."

278
00:51:58,260 --> 00:52:01,560
My Bey! We got ambushed!

279
00:52:38,672 --> 00:52:40,572
They are getting closer.

280
00:53:23,792 --> 00:53:26,162
Now, Alps!

281
00:54:41,445 --> 00:54:43,655
Come on Alps!

282
00:55:19,302 --> 00:55:20,962
Osman Bey.

283
00:55:24,329 --> 00:55:29,639
Osman Bey, zülfikar's news was a bait.

284
00:55:39,724 --> 00:55:42,164
They martyred Zülfikar.

285
00:56:06,438 --> 00:56:08,738
Take his body to his Sheik.

286
00:56:20,054 --> 00:56:22,664
Oh, Flatyos.

287
00:56:23,669 --> 00:56:27,269
I am sorry you couldn't see that.

288
00:56:28,977 --> 00:56:31,797
I'll take revenge for your father.

289
00:56:33,302 --> 00:56:41,622
I'll shave Turks off Bıtinya like I
shave my haris off!

290
00:56:58,515 --> 00:57:00,535
Good job.

291
00:57:02,788 --> 00:57:08,428
We'll break the whole Kayı with
one shot today.

292
00:57:09,970 --> 00:57:14,610
Let's see what Osman does when
he sees the papa.

293
00:57:14,737 --> 00:57:20,607
If Kolonoz had come, I'd have sent more
soldiers.

294
00:57:48,402 --> 00:57:53,592
I knew you were provoking your soldiers
against me because I didn't go to church.

295
00:57:53,800 --> 00:57:58,880
But I didn't know you were serving Osman.

296
00:58:02,706 --> 00:58:07,036
You told him how you could let Malhun
Hatun escape from the castle.

297
00:58:08,433 --> 00:58:09,993
Smart move.

298
00:58:10,982 --> 00:58:13,942
You know every secret of ours.

299
00:58:14,361 --> 00:58:21,381
You are too smart for a papa. Did Osman
buy you by gold?

300
00:58:23,475 --> 00:58:25,545
His name is Zülfikar.

301
00:58:27,193 --> 00:58:30,073
He was the student of edebalı.

302
00:58:32,664 --> 00:58:36,114
Whoa, whoa.

303
00:58:37,882 --> 00:58:40,562
A faithful dervish.

304
00:58:44,784 --> 00:58:47,464
What else does Osman know?

305
00:58:47,580 --> 00:58:51,770
Whatever he needs to know to take your
castle and cut your head off your body!

306
00:58:57,026 --> 00:59:01,166
"I bear witness that there is no god
but Allah, and...

307
00:59:01,166 --> 00:59:05,206
I bear witness that Muhammad
is the Messenger of Allah."

308
00:59:17,244 --> 00:59:22,514
Let's see if the latest news he gave
to Osman will end Osman or not.

309
00:59:22,759 --> 00:59:24,849
Zülfikar!

310
00:59:47,931 --> 00:59:50,741
Are you here to celebrate our victory,
Togay?

311
00:59:51,982 --> 00:59:59,452
When Gokboru dives in a jackals, he fights
with his paws so that his teeth stay clear.

312
01:00:00,588 --> 01:00:02,818
What doesd this mean?

313
01:00:02,963 --> 01:00:07,023
Osman killed the soldiers with his paws.

314
01:00:07,616 --> 01:00:10,006
None left alive.

315
01:00:10,921 --> 01:00:12,911
How can this be?

316
01:00:13,593 --> 01:00:15,578
How can you know that?

317
01:00:15,578 --> 01:00:20,658
A wounded soldier died in my hands while
coming here to tell you.

318
01:00:21,412 --> 01:00:23,202
Damn it.

319
01:00:26,052 --> 01:00:28,052
Osman.

320
01:00:28,913 --> 01:00:34,088
Gokboru gains power from his faith,
not his herd.

321
01:00:34,088 --> 01:00:37,218
His faith becomes his herd's faith.

322
01:00:37,760 --> 01:00:42,290
If you don't ruin his faith,
he'll ruin you.

323
01:00:42,383 --> 01:00:46,983
He will, and not by ruining just you.

324
01:00:48,761 --> 01:00:50,781
Damn it.

325
01:00:51,490 --> 01:00:54,427
I'll destroy Sogut!

326
01:00:54,427 --> 01:01:01,047
This would end you, Nicola. I advise you
to realise the treasure you have.

327
01:01:01,723 --> 01:01:04,783
- What treasure Togay?
- Malhun Hatun.

328
01:01:05,386 --> 01:01:09,376
Let Malhun Hatun open the doors
of Sogut for you.

329
01:01:15,022 --> 01:01:16,602
How?

330
01:01:23,720 --> 01:01:29,000
In the slightest mistake we make, he'll
kill my daughter.

331
01:01:31,246 --> 01:01:36,916
The moment he sees alps in front of his
castle, we lose Malhun.

332
01:01:38,130 --> 01:01:40,390
What are we going to do then, my Bey?

333
01:01:45,313 --> 01:01:47,303
We'll pay him.

334
01:01:48,844 --> 01:01:54,854
We'll pay Nicola to let Malhun free.

335
01:01:55,849 --> 01:01:57,999
He'll want everything we have, my Bey.

336
01:01:57,999 --> 01:02:03,569
Bahadır! My everything is in that
infidel's hands.

337
01:02:04,312 --> 01:02:08,532
We can recover the property.

338
01:02:09,433 --> 01:02:12,943
But she is my only daughter.

339
01:02:14,984 --> 01:02:16,554
Of coursemy Bey.

340
01:02:16,613 --> 01:02:19,573
- Can I come in my Bey?
- Come.

341
01:02:22,944 --> 01:02:26,045
Alaca Hatun! Where is my daughter?

342
01:02:26,045 --> 01:02:29,125
They let us free, but kept her, my Bey.

343
01:02:29,279 --> 01:02:32,178
What do they want?

344
01:02:32,178 --> 01:02:37,218
- Lord Nicola wants to see you my Bey.
- What is that about?

345
01:02:37,703 --> 01:02:44,193
He wants a secret meeting that nobody
hears. He said he'd let Malhun Hatun free.

346
01:02:46,028 --> 01:02:48,508
He will let her free, ha?

347
01:02:48,864 --> 01:02:54,244
My Bey! This may be a bait.
They may want to capture you as well.

348
01:02:55,149 --> 01:02:57,489
We can't reject this opportunity.

349
01:02:58,226 --> 01:03:01,726
As he said, I'll meet alone.

350
01:03:04,512 --> 01:03:08,422
We'll set off at dawn tomorrow.

351
01:03:08,522 --> 01:03:11,365
Take alps and come with me.

352
01:03:11,365 --> 01:03:13,355
As you command, my Bey.

353
01:03:56,634 --> 01:04:00,254
Are you now stealing hatuns' water,
Cerkutay?

354
01:04:01,995 --> 01:04:03,875
I need hot water?

355
01:04:03,971 --> 01:04:06,671
Why do you need hot water?

356
01:04:10,719 --> 01:04:14,699
- Alps doesn't question.
- Cerkutay.

357
01:04:17,017 --> 01:04:22,997
As Dervish Yunus said, people need to move
forward, so we will.

358
01:04:24,009 --> 01:04:26,649
They won't realise.

359
01:04:26,885 --> 01:04:31,115
As they martyr us, we'll reborn.

360
01:04:31,541 --> 01:04:34,376
They will think we are decreased.

361
01:04:34,376 --> 01:04:39,066
- I asked where you are taking it to!
- I won't tell you, you mad girl!

362
01:04:56,958 --> 01:05:02,098
What are you fighting for again, you two?

363
01:05:10,291 --> 01:05:13,351
- What is that water for?
- I won'T speak.

364
01:05:17,983 --> 01:05:23,343
Cerkutay, tell us.
What is that for?

365
01:05:23,711 --> 01:05:25,821
For Wudu .

366
01:05:28,477 --> 01:05:30,267
Is that right?

367
01:05:35,505 --> 01:05:39,245
Do alps use hot water for Wudu?

368
01:05:44,845 --> 01:05:47,175
Answer him, Cerkutay.

369
01:05:57,840 --> 01:05:59,600
It's not for me.

370
01:06:07,472 --> 01:06:09,492
So, for whom?

371
01:06:33,911 --> 01:06:38,811
So you take so much care of
Ghazi Bamsı Bey.

372
01:06:45,400 --> 01:06:51,080
What about you?
Why don't you take care of yourself?

373
01:06:58,660 --> 01:07:02,670
Hey, you valiant whose heart is muslim.

374
01:07:06,791 --> 01:07:09,991
Why are you still not saying shahada?

375
01:07:43,512 --> 01:07:45,142
I'm a cruel.

376
01:07:50,931 --> 01:07:52,631
I'm a cruel.

377
01:07:56,317 --> 01:07:58,427
I killed so many.

378
01:07:59,564 --> 01:08:02,464
I killed women.

379
01:08:02,699 --> 01:08:05,009
I killed children.

380
01:08:10,554 --> 01:08:12,454
I was cruel.

381
01:08:15,291 --> 01:08:18,111
I was cruel to the sinless.

382
01:08:20,800 --> 01:08:22,550
I am a cruel.

383
01:08:32,708 --> 01:08:35,298
Oy, oy, oy, oy.

384
01:08:35,445 --> 01:08:37,065
Son.

385
01:08:45,170 --> 01:08:47,330
Being muslim is so hard.

386
01:08:59,754 --> 01:09:02,284
I'd feel shy against Mohammad.

387
01:09:06,717 --> 01:09:09,107
I am afraid of his Allah.

388
01:09:26,882 --> 01:09:29,922
Can you be afraid of someone you love?

389
01:09:36,668 --> 01:09:38,898
Just repent.

390
01:09:42,808 --> 01:09:46,238
Repent turns poison into honey.

391
01:09:46,306 --> 01:09:49,186
It turns thorn into rose.

392
01:09:53,437 --> 01:09:57,437
Even cruels can enter.

393
01:10:10,109 --> 01:10:16,179
We have diwan for the comer, we have
water for the ones who take a Wudu.

394
01:10:38,508 --> 01:10:40,268
I'll come.

395
01:11:16,705 --> 01:11:18,335
Where is my daughter?

396
01:11:23,256 --> 01:11:24,796
Soldier!

397
01:11:25,911 --> 01:11:27,091
Get out!

398
01:11:32,866 --> 01:11:37,208
Aren't you sick of all these like me,
Umur Bey?

399
01:11:37,208 --> 01:11:39,718
What are you after Nicola?

400
01:11:39,972 --> 01:11:43,948
- I'm after your friendship.
- So why did you cooperate with Togay?

401
01:11:43,948 --> 01:11:45,718
Why did you capture my daughter?

402
01:11:45,718 --> 01:11:50,408
What should I have done? Should I have
faced Black Shaman Togay and Geyhatu...

403
01:11:50,663 --> 01:11:55,053
and run away from my lands?

404
01:11:55,243 --> 01:11:57,933
Don't Umur bey!

405
01:12:01,123 --> 01:12:03,053
Do not.

406
01:12:03,133 --> 01:12:06,043
Do not let my trust for you down.

407
01:12:07,041 --> 01:12:12,871
I am hosting you alone and unarmed
in my place.

408
01:12:18,065 --> 01:12:20,655
We both know...

409
01:12:22,589 --> 01:12:27,789
Neither you nor me can resist to
Geyhatu's power.

410
01:12:29,562 --> 01:12:32,742
I don't care about your daughter at all.

411
01:12:35,169 --> 01:12:41,879
Umur Bey, the only thing I wanted was my
Lord who Osman kidnapped.

412
01:12:41,879 --> 01:12:47,138
But Osman couldn't even bring him to me
safe and sound.

413
01:12:47,138 --> 01:12:51,118
He couldn't protect you jus tlike he
couldn't protect my Lord.

414
01:12:52,086 --> 01:12:58,386
As for me, my intention is to
trade with Turks.

415
01:12:58,488 --> 01:13:02,630
That decent Beys like you be at my border
isn't only safe for me...

416
01:13:02,630 --> 01:13:05,360
but it is also safe for my empire.

417
01:13:05,360 --> 01:13:09,700
I feel safe when Geyhatu is busy with you.

418
01:13:11,182 --> 01:13:14,792
Umur Bey, you are a Turk Bey
who is a honorable...

419
01:13:15,098 --> 01:13:18,468
You are a Bey who challanged Geyhatu.

420
01:13:18,980 --> 01:13:23,890
But in the end, you ended
up at my borders.

421
01:13:24,862 --> 01:13:30,662
That I have Beys like you at my border
keep me away from Mongols and trouble.

422
01:13:30,768 --> 01:13:35,608
And by the way, I worked with Togay
because of you.

423
01:13:36,958 --> 01:13:39,608
- What about Osman?
- Osman.

424
01:13:40,384 --> 01:13:47,104
Osman is young. He is a dasher.
He wants the treasure in my land.

425
01:13:47,548 --> 01:13:53,178
But both you and me know that the biggest
treasure is trading.

426
01:13:54,267 --> 01:13:59,295
I think an experienced Bey like you can
take charge of Osman...

427
01:13:59,295 --> 01:14:03,295
whose head is in the clouds, Umur Bey.

428
01:14:04,211 --> 01:14:10,107
I prefer you kill me and my daughter right
here right now...

429
01:14:10,107 --> 01:14:12,447
instead of betraying Osman Bey.

430
01:14:12,447 --> 01:14:15,457
Umur Bey, oh Umur Bey.

431
01:14:15,551 --> 01:14:19,391
What I want from you is not betrayal.

432
01:14:19,429 --> 01:14:23,618
I want you to be a big brother to Osman.
You should show him the way...

433
01:14:23,618 --> 01:14:26,308
keep him out of trouble.

434
01:14:28,289 --> 01:14:30,029
How?

435
01:14:30,336 --> 01:14:32,606
How can I do that?

436
01:14:32,634 --> 01:14:33,929
What are you thinking of?

437
01:14:34,929 --> 01:14:40,029
Umur Bey, I'll give you an opportunity to
enhance our friendship and...

438
01:14:40,029 --> 01:14:42,259
we'll make trade.

439
01:14:44,268 --> 01:14:47,318
I need four hundred horses.

440
01:14:48,070 --> 01:14:52,341
For you to give them to your soldiers
in war?

441
01:14:52,341 --> 01:14:55,528
For you to trample Kayı Tent down with
their hooves?

442
01:14:55,528 --> 01:15:02,108
No no no. In order to resist to Geyhatu
When he comes here,

443
01:15:04,007 --> 01:15:09,335
Umur Bey, Turks are not a threat for me.
Mongols are.

444
01:15:09,335 --> 01:15:14,780
While we are fighting each other with
Osman here, Geyhatu already got Ilhanlı.

445
01:15:14,780 --> 01:15:20,819
Sooner or later he's going to come here.
I want to have power to resist...

446
01:15:20,819 --> 01:15:24,169
when the trouble knocks on my door.

447
01:15:25,591 --> 01:15:30,641
You'll give me horses.
I'll open the trade door of...

448
01:15:31,178 --> 01:15:38,998
Iznık, Bursa, Constantinople, Umur Bey.

449
01:15:40,394 --> 01:15:42,914
Furthermore, you'll not pay fees.

450
01:15:43,037 --> 01:15:49,127
And so, with the gold you gain, you can
control Osman...

451
01:15:49,657 --> 01:15:52,007
who is acting like a brutal horse.

452
01:15:55,634 --> 01:16:04,184
You are offering me trade routes in return
of keeping Osman down, right?

453
01:16:04,313 --> 01:16:15,793
Umur Bey, I want to live in peace, gain
strenght with the help of your friendship...

454
01:16:19,036 --> 01:16:24,946
What if I run off with Malhun and
never give you those horses?

455
01:16:25,955 --> 01:16:30,805
I know you are such a red-blooded Bey
who won't betray Osman.

456
01:16:31,124 --> 01:16:37,264
Just like I know you are a honorable Bey
who won't live in the shadow of Osman.

457
01:16:37,417 --> 01:16:40,497
Decision is yours, Umur Bey.

458
01:16:41,866 --> 01:16:47,948
Those soldiers who will ride the horses,
who will fight against the Mongols should...

459
01:16:47,948 --> 01:16:52,928
be able to ride a horse as well as
a Turk.

460
01:16:53,796 --> 01:16:55,926
What is your offer?

461
01:17:00,170 --> 01:17:02,770
- Father.
- Daughter.

462
01:17:12,092 --> 01:17:17,262
Umur Bey.
What is your offer?

463
01:17:28,403 --> 01:17:34,963
There are stable boys who can educate
the horses I'll send you.

464
01:17:36,800 --> 01:17:42,156
To educate your soldiers against
our common enemies.

465
01:17:42,156 --> 01:17:44,026
Smartly.

466
01:17:44,345 --> 01:17:46,725
Smartly said.

467
01:17:48,646 --> 01:17:51,266
I kept my word.

468
01:17:51,459 --> 01:17:54,759
I gave you your daughter safe and sound.

469
01:17:56,157 --> 01:17:59,127
Now it's your turn.

470
01:18:02,933 --> 01:18:04,503
I'll think about it...

471
01:18:06,701 --> 01:18:09,391
and notify you soon.

472
01:18:11,340 --> 01:18:16,100
Dear Helen, see our guests off.

473
01:18:17,724 --> 01:18:20,464
May your path be open.

474
01:18:23,860 --> 01:18:25,340
This way.

475
01:18:47,822 --> 01:18:50,862
Father, what horses is this ignobl
talking about?

476
01:18:53,011 --> 01:18:55,961
I'll tell you once we arrive in the tent.

477
01:19:43,296 --> 01:19:46,866
You are the biggest fraud I have ever seen
Nikola.

478
01:19:48,755 --> 01:19:54,625
You will raise warrior cavalries from
Kalanoz's soldiers.

479
01:19:57,317 --> 01:20:03,747
Against Lord of the Lords Geyhatu.

480
01:20:05,638 --> 01:20:11,608
With them, I will not only take Söğüt
but also Bitinya.

481
01:20:13,227 --> 01:20:17,707
I will exterminate Geyhatu's enemies
in this land.

482
01:20:20,091 --> 01:20:22,601
Of course, with your help, Togay.

483
01:20:34,878 --> 01:20:37,228
He was a valiant dervish.

484
01:20:38,297 --> 01:20:43,187
He accepted the hardest mission.

485
01:20:45,940 --> 01:20:51,850
He got into the infidel's heart and
became our eyes and ears.

486
01:21:01,352 --> 01:21:03,762
Allah...

487
01:21:04,596 --> 01:21:08,156
... may forgive him.
Rest in peace.

488
01:21:08,285 --> 01:21:10,455
-Amin.
-Amin.

489
01:21:10,615 --> 01:21:13,355
-Amin.
-Amin.

490
01:21:13,803 --> 01:21:16,593
We lost another valiant.

491
01:21:17,975 --> 01:21:22,745
Then we will take another valiant's
revenge.

492
01:21:23,772 --> 01:21:25,472
We will.

493
01:21:26,508 --> 01:21:29,138
We will take his revenge.

494
01:21:31,691 --> 01:21:36,601
We will all stand up for the cause
they died for.

495
01:21:38,338 --> 01:21:45,498
As our martyrs march to heaven,
we will draw our swords for victory.

496
01:21:47,972 --> 01:21:50,632
Inform the Turkmen tribes.

497
01:21:51,317 --> 01:21:55,687
Say Osman Bey is opening his flag.

498
01:21:56,293 --> 01:22:02,533
All the Beys shall gather soldiers for
our army.

499
01:22:07,222 --> 01:22:10,492
What about Malhun Hatun, Osman Bey?

500
01:22:11,058 --> 01:22:13,938
I will set up this game to get her back.

501
01:22:14,299 --> 01:22:17,959
It is broken by the martyrdom of Zülfikar.

502
01:22:19,859 --> 01:22:25,761
What about Umur Bey? He is gone.
He wants to act alone.

503
01:22:25,981 --> 01:22:28,211
I know, Emmi.

504
01:22:28,814 --> 01:22:30,574
I know.

505
01:22:30,726 --> 01:22:36,976
But I already set up my new plan.

506
01:22:40,046 --> 01:22:45,136
Nikola will think that we are desperate.

507
01:22:46,805 --> 01:22:49,455
He can think so.

508
01:22:49,983 --> 01:22:54,963
We'll say we'll ransom to get her.

509
01:22:56,082 --> 01:23:00,412
He will suspect at first but...

510
01:23:00,521 --> 01:23:04,521
... he will accept it later on.

511
01:23:05,660 --> 01:23:12,870
We will both get Malhun Hatun and finish
our business with Nikola.

512
01:23:15,309 --> 01:23:20,729
However, Umur Bey is also considering
paying the ransom.

513
01:23:20,842 --> 01:23:26,022
He will want to negotiate with Nikola
this time.

514
01:23:26,933 --> 01:23:30,173
First, we must stop Umur Bey.

515
01:23:31,261 --> 01:23:36,241
Let's not lose any time.
May Allah be with us.

516
01:23:36,410 --> 01:23:40,260
-Amin.
-Amin.

517
01:23:48,836 --> 01:23:51,526
Thankfully, this is over.

518
01:23:51,589 --> 01:23:58,499
But I was so worried that infidel was to
break his word.

519
01:23:59,755 --> 01:24:04,655
What should we think, Father?
Did he scruple to kill me?

520
01:24:04,936 --> 01:24:08,936
Of course, he did.
He is aware of our power.

521
01:24:09,673 --> 01:24:16,243
Obviously, he investigated us well and
what he found out scared him.

522
01:24:16,246 --> 01:24:23,326
He chose to benefit by trading rather than
fighting Kızılbeyoğlu and get ruined.

523
01:24:24,680 --> 01:24:32,320
He is a two tongue snake. If one says
peace the other says warç

524
01:24:32,407 --> 01:24:38,897
You are worried Nikola is playing and
trapping your father right?

525
01:24:40,100 --> 01:24:43,750
Thinking that Togay is with him.

526
01:24:43,865 --> 01:24:45,865
Can I come in, my Bey?

527
01:24:45,957 --> 01:24:47,797
Come in.

528
01:24:52,523 --> 01:24:56,523
My Bey, Osman Bey and Bala Hatun
are here.

529
01:25:03,038 --> 01:25:05,408
Let them in.

530
01:25:14,879 --> 01:25:16,369
Umur Bey.

531
01:25:17,769 --> 01:25:22,169
Osman Bey, Bala Hatun.

532
01:25:23,384 --> 01:25:25,844
Welcome, Osman Bey.

533
01:25:43,828 --> 01:25:46,708
Malhun Hatun.

534
01:26:08,175 --> 01:26:10,415
So you are back.

535
01:26:12,875 --> 01:26:15,825
Welcome back.

536
01:26:20,556 --> 01:26:23,376
How could that infidel let you go?

537
01:26:30,103 --> 01:26:34,813
Isn't there enough trouble for him,
Osman Bey?

538
01:26:36,134 --> 01:26:37,974
Thanks to you...

539
01:26:38,192 --> 01:26:44,922
... he couldn't consider going against us.

540
01:26:52,599 --> 01:26:55,299
They killed my Zülfikay...

541
01:26:55,691 --> 01:26:59,191
... my valiant dervish.

542
01:27:01,915 --> 01:27:04,655
I paid hard for this.

543
01:27:09,988 --> 01:27:12,588
I'm sorry for your loss, Osman Bey.

544
01:27:15,263 --> 01:27:18,023
I hope his place is heaven.

545
01:27:23,873 --> 01:27:25,763
Thank you.

546
01:27:26,152 --> 01:27:29,672
Thank you, but...

547
01:27:29,905 --> 01:27:33,955
...the murder of the man sent for
barter...

548
01:27:34,622 --> 01:27:40,862
... the unexpected release of Malhun Hatun
...

549
01:27:43,944 --> 01:27:48,144
... shows that this is a vile game.

550
01:27:50,671 --> 01:27:53,481
Doesn't it, Umur Bey?

551
01:28:18,623 --> 01:28:26,276
I came to check on the women of tribe,
if they have any trouble.

552
01:28:26,446 --> 01:28:29,506
You thought well, Bala Hatun.

553
01:28:29,604 --> 01:28:35,434
My absence was their only problem.
Since I am back, there is no problem.

554
01:28:36,180 --> 01:28:42,990
Being in the dungeons when you should have
been with your women caused us trouble.

555
01:28:43,854 --> 01:28:48,374
Since you are back, we can rest now.

556
01:28:55,249 --> 01:29:01,269
Maşallah, Maşallah.

557
01:29:04,605 --> 01:29:07,995
You must have missed each other.

558
01:29:10,651 --> 01:29:13,901
We have things to do.

559
01:29:15,405 --> 01:29:20,025
Thank you for coming.

560
01:29:21,911 --> 01:29:26,251
Sure, Umur Bey.

561
01:30:33,197 --> 01:30:37,197
What is that you can not say with your
sweet mouth, my Bala?

562
01:30:43,406 --> 01:30:49,056
I know, like me, you don't believe
Umur Bey either, my Bey.

563
01:30:54,151 --> 01:30:59,801
Nikola wants to get along with him by
giving him his daughter.

564
01:31:00,758 --> 01:31:06,648
He wants to set us against each other,
with Umur Bey.

565
01:31:07,328 --> 01:31:11,058
What about you?
What will you say, my Bey?

566
01:31:16,897 --> 01:31:22,887
I will watch them, my Bala.
I will watch them.

567
01:31:31,963 --> 01:31:35,093
Boran and Gonca Hatun are waiting.

568
01:31:36,416 --> 01:31:42,546
If we look for a day without trouble,
we will not find a day to feast.

569
01:31:44,730 --> 01:31:49,030
Are you saying it, my Osman?
Shall the wedding feast begin?

570
01:31:51,491 --> 01:31:56,171
It shall begin.

571
01:31:57,368 --> 01:32:02,398
Boran, come here.

572
01:32:04,570 --> 01:32:06,890
Come here.

573
01:32:11,459 --> 01:32:14,059
Yes, my Bey.

574
01:32:15,966 --> 01:32:18,736
Why are you keeping Gonca Hatun await?

575
01:32:20,660 --> 01:32:23,600
Marry her if you will.

576
01:32:24,232 --> 01:32:26,142
My Bey.

577
01:32:38,179 --> 01:32:41,309
It seems you don't have any
preparation.

578
01:32:44,461 --> 01:32:49,421
Then, let's arrange a feast at Söğüt.

579
01:32:50,194 --> 01:32:55,004
Set a huge table. Everyone will join.

580
01:32:55,158 --> 01:32:59,388
Also, those in need will be happy.

581
01:33:00,726 --> 01:33:03,896
- What do you think, my Bala?
- That's nice, my Osman.

582
01:33:06,461 --> 01:33:09,491
- Your command, my Bey.
- Yes, I command.

583
01:33:17,399 --> 01:33:18,339
Come on.

584
01:33:18,410 --> 01:33:21,000
Start the preparations.

585
01:33:33,184 --> 01:33:34,074
Alps!

586
01:33:35,434 --> 01:33:37,754
Come on.
We're leaving.

587
01:33:47,839 --> 01:33:49,369
Come on.

588
01:33:50,794 --> 01:33:52,214
Come on.

589
01:34:01,794 --> 01:34:06,464
Nikola wants 400 horses from us.

590
01:34:07,321 --> 01:34:12,591
However, we only have 100 horses to sell.

591
01:34:13,770 --> 01:34:17,940
We should go to Söğüt and
see the merchants.

592
01:34:18,653 --> 01:34:24,123
It will be possible if we
have their horses too.

593
01:34:24,195 --> 01:34:27,635
Will we sell horses to non-Muslims
so that they can attack Turks?

594
01:34:29,480 --> 01:34:34,000
You will lead them when
the caravan enters İnegöl.

595
01:34:39,410 --> 01:34:43,830
The grooms will go İnegöl with the horses.

596
01:34:44,894 --> 01:34:50,564
Nikola may think of attacking Turks
with the Turk horses.

597
01:34:50,961 --> 01:34:54,021
I think of something too.

598
01:34:55,959 --> 01:34:59,959
Bahadır says those walls
can't be surpassed.

599
01:35:01,217 --> 01:35:06,317
- Then we will open the door inside.
- Yes.

600
01:35:07,341 --> 01:35:11,341
And we will send our Alps.

601
01:35:11,640 --> 01:35:15,640
We will take the castle
that Osman Bey wants to take.

602
01:35:21,774 --> 01:35:24,014
Alaca Hatun!

603
01:35:26,676 --> 01:35:27,916
Yes, my Bey.

604
01:35:28,558 --> 01:35:32,108
Prepare us a dining table.

605
01:35:32,680 --> 01:35:36,680
I will eat with my daughter.

606
01:35:54,412 --> 01:35:57,312
It will look good on you, my Gonca.

607
01:36:01,406 --> 01:36:04,916
I wish Selcan Mother was here.

608
01:36:09,162 --> 01:36:12,162
Selcan Mother couldn't come but...

609
01:36:14,263 --> 01:36:17,523
she may come to Aygül's wedding.

610
01:36:23,884 --> 01:36:27,104
Who says that I will have
a wedding, Bala Hatun?

611
01:36:28,569 --> 01:36:30,019
You can't guess.

612
01:36:30,845 --> 01:36:33,755
A man may seem good to you.

613
01:36:42,056 --> 01:36:44,246
He wouldn't dare.

614
01:36:50,775 --> 01:36:53,385
Come on, Hatuns!

615
01:36:53,828 --> 01:36:55,728
Work.

616
01:36:56,588 --> 01:36:59,138
We have a wedding.

617
01:37:09,959 --> 01:37:12,259
It is Nikola's and Togay's trick.

618
01:37:12,645 --> 01:37:18,405
What they want to do is to face off
Osman against Umur Bey.

619
01:37:19,339 --> 01:37:22,899
- Then who killed the Lord?
- Togay.

620
01:37:24,317 --> 01:37:30,347
He wants to deal with Nikola in return
for Umur Bey and Osman.

621
01:37:41,647 --> 01:37:46,147
- Malhun Hatun is coming.
- Togay...

622
01:37:46,671 --> 01:37:50,641
- He did it again.
- She shouldn't know I'm here.

623
01:38:09,299 --> 01:38:12,739
- May it be easy.
- Thank you, my Hanım.

624
01:38:13,346 --> 01:38:17,346
- Welcome.
- Welcome.

625
01:38:18,089 --> 01:38:21,509
They say you are the strongest
merchants around.

626
01:38:21,664 --> 01:38:23,154
Thanks to them.

627
01:38:23,700 --> 01:38:26,880
Merchant Abdullah bin Melik.

628
01:38:27,170 --> 01:38:32,260
What do you need? There's
nothing we can't supply.

629
01:38:32,629 --> 01:38:35,669
I want 100 horses.
Quick.

630
01:38:37,600 --> 01:38:42,650
Can I ask you why?

631
01:38:49,054 --> 01:38:52,264
We will have a trade
in İnegöl Castle.

632
01:38:55,657 --> 01:38:58,587
When will you give me the horses?

633
01:38:59,057 --> 01:38:59,857
However...

634
01:39:01,361 --> 01:39:04,241
selling horses to Osman Bey's enemy...

635
01:39:04,972 --> 01:39:10,312
will endanger not only you but also us.

636
01:39:10,418 --> 01:39:12,508
It can't happen.

637
01:39:14,127 --> 01:39:16,877
Aren't you a merchant?

638
01:39:17,243 --> 01:39:21,243
Do your job.
The rest is my responsibility.

639
01:39:22,955 --> 01:39:25,245
I'm sorry.

640
01:39:25,371 --> 01:39:29,111
However, we don't sell animals.

641
01:39:30,092 --> 01:39:37,002
We don't do that kind of stuff. However,
what we spoke will stay between us.

642
01:39:38,067 --> 01:39:42,297
It's a secret.
Have a good journey, my Hanım.

643
01:39:57,770 --> 01:40:01,820
Wow, wow.

644
01:40:04,591 --> 01:40:09,271
Nikola dealt with them obviously.

645
01:40:09,441 --> 01:40:15,461
If we gave horses to her, Osman
would kill us.

646
01:40:17,676 --> 01:40:20,596
Let's see what it leads to.

647
01:40:21,398 --> 01:40:23,958
We know what it leads to.

648
01:40:24,085 --> 01:40:28,335
Osman Bey and Umur Bey will fight.

649
01:40:46,787 --> 01:40:49,427
- May it be easy.
- Thank you, my Bey. Welcome.

650
01:40:49,467 --> 01:40:53,907
- Welcome, my Bey.
- Welcome to our bazaar, my Bey.

651
01:40:54,117 --> 01:40:58,427
- May it be easy.
- Welcome, my Bey.

652
01:40:58,661 --> 01:41:01,921
Welcome, my Bey.

653
01:41:01,940 --> 01:41:03,630
Thank you.

654
01:41:03,689 --> 01:41:07,029
- Welcome, my Bey.
- Have a good work.

655
01:41:11,632 --> 01:41:12,782
Welcome, my Bey.

656
01:41:12,928 --> 01:41:15,088
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

657
01:41:16,575 --> 01:41:19,845
- May it be easy.
- Thank you, my Bey.

658
01:41:32,210 --> 01:41:34,090
Mashallah, it tastes the same.

659
01:41:34,254 --> 01:41:38,574
- I always have the best one, my Bey.
- Thank you.

660
01:41:45,122 --> 01:41:47,372
- May it be easy.
- Thank you, my Bey.

661
01:41:48,130 --> 01:41:49,340
Uncle.

662
01:41:57,078 --> 01:41:58,468
What happened?

663
01:41:59,668 --> 01:42:01,948
We have news from
Malhun Hatun, Osman Bey.

664
01:42:03,785 --> 01:42:05,405
What is it?

665
01:42:05,895 --> 01:42:09,565
We know why Nikola left Malhun Hatun free.

666
01:42:10,862 --> 01:42:15,122
Nikola and Umur Bey made
a trade agreement.

667
01:42:16,134 --> 01:42:19,514
Umur Bey will sell horses to Nikola.

668
01:42:19,643 --> 01:42:25,243
His daughter Malhun is looking
for 100 horses.

669
01:42:25,478 --> 01:42:27,798
What are you saying, uncle?

670
01:42:28,666 --> 01:42:30,736
Horses are the swords.

671
01:42:30,981 --> 01:42:32,931
You can't give them to the enemy.

672
01:42:33,576 --> 01:42:37,346
I did everything I could so that they
couldn't supply what they need.

673
01:42:37,464 --> 01:42:39,604
Don't worry.

674
01:42:44,844 --> 01:42:48,164
Thank you, uncle.

675
01:43:17,704 --> 01:43:19,974
Malhun Hatun!

676
01:43:23,957 --> 01:43:25,407
Yes, Osman Bey.

677
01:43:28,597 --> 01:43:31,657
Did I give you things so that
you could be my enemy?

678
01:43:31,741 --> 01:43:34,871
What are you talking about, Osman Bey?

679
01:43:35,053 --> 01:43:37,833
Isn't Nikola my enemy?

680
01:43:37,921 --> 01:43:40,721
Am I not fighting with him?

681
01:43:40,775 --> 01:43:45,595
You being friends with him means you
are my enemy.

682
01:43:45,967 --> 01:43:48,207
Tell me what you want to say, Osman Bey.

683
01:43:48,401 --> 01:43:54,011
How can you sell horses to my enemy while
it is up to me that you do a trade?

684
01:43:55,782 --> 01:43:59,012
- How did you hear about that?
- Answer my question.

685
01:43:59,514 --> 01:44:02,224
Our tent needs that trade.

686
01:44:02,424 --> 01:44:04,124
Why is it wrong?

687
01:44:04,258 --> 01:44:06,758
You are selling horses to my
enemy, so that...

688
01:44:06,862 --> 01:44:09,952
he can kill my Alps easily and...

689
01:44:10,029 --> 01:44:12,739
he can attack Muslims!

690
01:44:14,443 --> 01:44:18,443
Bayhoca's blood is still fresh.

691
01:44:19,448 --> 01:44:23,118
Now go and tell your father...

692
01:44:23,203 --> 01:44:26,733
I don't have consent for this.

693
01:44:27,245 --> 01:44:29,435
And tell him...

694
01:44:29,503 --> 01:44:33,503
he should be afraid of my wrath!

695
01:44:46,589 --> 01:44:47,889
Come on!

696
01:44:59,118 --> 01:45:00,838
Baysungur.

697
01:45:02,393 --> 01:45:03,233
My Bey.

698
01:45:03,676 --> 01:45:06,996
They won't stop.
Follow them.

699
01:45:07,989 --> 01:45:09,949
Your command, my Bey.

700
01:45:21,632 --> 01:45:24,672
Osman Bey's last words mean a
threat to us.

701
01:45:24,751 --> 01:45:26,391
What will we do?

702
01:45:26,551 --> 01:45:31,481
He is afraid of falling from grace.

703
01:45:33,266 --> 01:45:36,276
He doesn't want us to be powerful.

704
01:45:37,770 --> 01:45:43,080
If he finds out we will send
our men to İnegöl Castle...

705
01:45:43,784 --> 01:45:49,114
while he is trying to gather some
Beys to do the same...

706
01:45:51,685 --> 01:45:54,135
Osman Bey will prevent us
from finding horses.

707
01:45:54,195 --> 01:45:57,385
Then we will give the horses we can find.

708
01:45:59,297 --> 01:46:02,637
The caravan will be on the road today.

709
01:46:47,801 --> 01:46:48,951
Kalanoz.

710
01:46:51,063 --> 01:46:55,713
He will be in my castle
with his army three days later.

711
01:46:56,274 --> 01:47:00,274
Before your army comes, Osman
shouldn't be seen.

712
01:47:01,660 --> 01:47:07,310
Only me and you know that
Kalanoz is coming.

713
01:47:12,618 --> 01:47:17,048
I scratched Osman's men's
eyes in the castle.

714
01:47:18,169 --> 01:47:21,129
He can't get any information.

715
01:47:21,526 --> 01:47:26,456
I will equip
the cavalry coming with Kalanoz.

716
01:47:27,021 --> 01:47:30,081
It will make me more powerful.

717
01:47:30,739 --> 01:47:34,209
If you don't play trick behind me.

718
01:47:35,516 --> 01:47:39,516
I won't. Don't worry.

719
01:47:39,961 --> 01:47:45,181
Only if you give me some of your
soldiers to command me.

720
01:47:46,937 --> 01:47:50,037
- I will make your work easier.
- How?

721
01:47:50,987 --> 01:47:58,847
Osman's aide, Boran Alp, will marry soon.

722
01:48:02,954 --> 01:48:05,694
They won't have a wedding night.

723
01:48:12,626 --> 01:48:16,626
I will destroy Osman's belief in Allah...

724
01:48:16,626 --> 01:48:20,626
and destroy his army's trust in him.

725
01:48:21,904 --> 01:48:26,384
The new bride's blood will
paint Osman's tent red.

726
01:48:28,804 --> 01:48:34,274
While Osman's tent is in the
grief of the new bride...

727
01:48:35,273 --> 01:48:39,633
you will go to Söğüt.

728
01:48:47,888 --> 01:48:52,058
You thought I couldn't see
your wedding feast, huh?

729
01:49:08,377 --> 01:49:13,447
Thank Allah, Göktuğ.
Inshallah, we can see yours too.

730
01:49:42,195 --> 01:49:45,035
For our Zülfikar brother...

731
01:49:46,373 --> 01:49:48,603
Al-Fatihah.

732
01:50:07,678 --> 01:50:13,638
May Allah let Zülfikar brother
go to heaven.

733
01:50:14,396 --> 01:50:17,336
Amin.

734
01:50:17,444 --> 01:50:20,554
We are all sad.

735
01:50:20,591 --> 01:50:21,781
Hewever...

736
01:50:22,563 --> 01:50:26,563
our Efendi, our Prophet...

737
01:50:27,475 --> 01:50:32,515
commanded us to marry
and to have children.

738
01:50:38,745 --> 01:50:42,505
He said he will be proud
of our abundance...

739
01:50:42,505 --> 01:50:46,255
on the day of judgment.

740
01:50:46,977 --> 01:50:54,067
For this reason, we
will marry and we will have children.

741
01:50:57,556 --> 01:51:00,486
The Kayı Tent will be bigger.

742
01:51:01,196 --> 01:51:03,106
It will make its people feel safe...

743
01:51:04,278 --> 01:51:09,318
and its enemies fear.

744
01:51:25,891 --> 01:51:29,891
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

745
01:51:31,624 --> 01:51:34,704
You gave us honor, my Sheikh.

746
01:51:34,718 --> 01:51:37,828
I'm glad you're here, my Sheikh.

747
01:51:41,743 --> 01:51:43,843
Thank you, my daughter.

748
01:51:47,057 --> 01:51:48,887
My Sheikh.

749
01:51:56,009 --> 01:51:58,269
Mashallah, my daughter Gonca.

750
01:51:59,904 --> 01:52:01,554
My Sheikh.

751
01:52:04,244 --> 01:52:06,574
Mashallah, my Boran Alp.

752
01:52:09,198 --> 01:52:13,198
May Allah grant you happiness..

753
01:52:13,797 --> 01:52:17,797
and with better intentions.

754
01:52:18,390 --> 01:52:20,000
Amin.

755
01:52:23,507 --> 01:52:29,547
Stay together when you are
happy or in pain.

756
01:52:29,570 --> 01:52:32,120
Inshallah.

757
01:52:32,165 --> 01:52:36,165
Raise your children for Kayı and Islam.

758
01:52:36,314 --> 01:52:40,314
- Inshallah.
- Inshallah, my Sheikh.

759
01:52:54,284 --> 01:53:00,074
My brother, Boran Alp is very excited.

760
01:53:01,532 --> 01:53:05,532
We were the same as him, brother.

761
01:53:05,873 --> 01:53:09,363
They are finally together.

762
01:53:11,718 --> 01:53:14,368
Abdurrahman Ghazi...

763
01:53:14,848 --> 01:53:18,038
We are old now, huh?

764
01:53:18,558 --> 01:53:21,728
Yes, brother.

765
01:53:22,728 --> 01:53:30,068
May Allah grant us to leave
this life with Shahada.

766
01:53:31,070 --> 01:53:35,070
Inshallah, my Ghazi.
Inshallah.

767
01:53:36,625 --> 01:53:39,325
Amin.

768
01:54:05,213 --> 01:54:09,423
What, mad woman? Why
are standing alone?

769
01:54:09,513 --> 01:54:12,663
Why aren't you with the Alps?

770
01:54:14,740 --> 01:54:17,580
Göktuğ is with Boran.

771
01:54:17,839 --> 01:54:20,409
Bamsı Bey is with Abdurrahman Ghazi.

772
01:54:22,056 --> 01:54:24,666
- I...
- You...

773
01:54:26,215 --> 01:54:29,615
I wanted someone mad like me.

774
01:54:31,348 --> 01:54:35,168
- Stop it.
- Stop what?

775
01:54:36,561 --> 01:54:39,811
Stop saying these words.

776
01:55:19,391 --> 01:55:22,221
I told you, my Bey.

777
01:55:23,753 --> 01:55:28,263
A warrior's lover is his sword.

778
01:55:36,903 --> 01:55:40,903
This is the hardest of all wars, Cerkutay.

779
01:55:42,621 --> 01:55:46,001
This is the hardest of all wars.

780
01:56:35,851 --> 01:56:37,721
Don't worry, father.

781
01:56:37,861 --> 01:56:41,331
We will go safe and sound, Inshallah.

782
01:56:41,701 --> 01:56:47,031
We don't know those lands.
Be careful.

783
01:56:52,872 --> 01:56:54,162
Bahadır!

784
01:56:54,841 --> 01:56:59,831
Take care of my daughter.

785
01:57:02,072 --> 01:57:03,862
Okay, my Bey.

786
01:57:05,793 --> 01:57:08,253
If Nikola asks why the horses lack...

787
01:57:08,253 --> 01:57:12,253
I will tell him we will get
more with the grooms as soon as possible.

788
01:57:12,409 --> 01:57:13,509
Okay.

789
01:57:14,065 --> 01:57:18,725
Tell the grooms what they will do there.

790
01:57:18,857 --> 01:57:25,067
They will be our eyes and
ears in İnegöl Castle.

791
01:57:27,079 --> 01:57:27,859
Come on.

792
01:57:29,051 --> 01:57:31,841
Have a good journey.

793
01:57:52,824 --> 01:57:57,084
May Allah help you.

794
01:57:59,544 --> 01:58:05,854
Thank you.

795
01:58:15,053 --> 01:58:16,213
My Bey.

796
01:58:16,349 --> 01:58:20,079
Umur Bey's caravan is going to İnegöl.

797
01:58:26,151 --> 01:58:29,631
She didn't listen to me.

798
01:58:30,921 --> 01:58:33,881
She didn't listen to me.

799
01:58:35,903 --> 01:58:39,633
- What happened, Osman Bey?
- Umur Bey...

800
01:58:39,686 --> 01:58:43,416
Umur Bey takes horses to İnegöl.

801
01:58:44,799 --> 01:58:49,039
- You say so?
- Nikola won't get those horses.

802
01:58:51,234 --> 01:58:55,234
Boran. Stay here with my
brother and uncle.

803
01:58:55,435 --> 01:58:56,845
Don't leave the feast alone.

804
01:58:56,895 --> 01:58:59,645
We don't know what
unbelievers are capable of.

805
01:58:59,756 --> 01:59:05,696
- Hatuns! Go to the tent.
- Your command, my Bey.

806
01:59:07,712 --> 01:59:09,152
Come on, Alps!

807
01:59:23,239 --> 01:59:28,439
The wind is with me.

808
01:59:43,258 --> 01:59:45,708
The arrow...

809
01:59:48,334 --> 01:59:51,644
is with the death!

810
02:01:16,374 --> 02:01:18,894
Alps!
Battle order!

811
02:01:30,243 --> 02:01:32,583
Protect Hatuns!

812
02:01:43,303 --> 02:01:44,803
Boran.

813
02:01:46,470 --> 02:01:48,330
Be careful!

814
02:02:13,396 --> 02:02:15,076
Mother!

815
02:02:24,789 --> 02:02:27,149
Come on!
Come on!

816
02:02:32,376 --> 02:02:35,606
- Come on.
- Allah is eternal!

817
02:02:35,725 --> 02:02:38,375
Come on, valiants!

818
02:03:46,942 --> 02:03:49,182
The arrow...

819
02:03:50,896 --> 02:03:53,346
is with the death.

820
02:04:29,714 --> 02:04:32,014
Gonca!

821
02:04:34,365 --> 02:04:37,795
Gonca!

822
02:04:42,402 --> 02:04:43,642
Gonca!

823
02:04:45,200 --> 02:04:46,870
Gonca!

824
02:04:54,348 --> 02:04:55,618
Gonca!

825
02:04:58,774 --> 02:05:00,764
Gonca!

826
02:05:01,919 --> 02:05:02,889
Togay.

827
02:05:03,561 --> 02:05:06,951
Boran!

828
02:05:17,940 --> 02:05:21,700
- Abdurrahman Ghazi!
- Abdurrahman Ghazi!

829
02:05:26,439 --> 02:05:28,529
Abdurrahman Ghazi!

830
02:05:34,126 --> 02:05:38,576
- Abdurrahman Ghazi!
- My Ghazi!

831
02:05:52,508 --> 02:05:56,048
Hold on, my Ghazi!

832
02:05:59,465 --> 02:06:03,465
Don't leave me, my Ghazi.
Hold on.

833
02:06:06,762 --> 02:06:10,802
I think my time is over, brother.

834
02:06:10,842 --> 02:06:12,322
Don't say that.

835
02:06:17,485 --> 02:06:21,485
My Gonca!

836
02:06:21,691 --> 02:06:26,181
Abdurrahman Ghazi...

837
02:06:34,949 --> 02:06:38,549
Don't leave me alone, my Ghazi.

838
02:06:38,671 --> 02:06:42,901
Allah heard our prayers, brother.

839
02:06:47,193 --> 02:06:53,233
"I bear witness that there
is no deity but Allah...

840
02:06:55,215 --> 02:07:03,735
...and I bear witness that Muhammad
is the messenger of Allah."

841
02:07:16,616 --> 02:07:18,926
