- I already said what I have to say.

845
02:09:26,003 --> 02:09:30,003
The swords speak when
words are not enough.

846
02:09:32,936 --> 02:09:34,106
Alps!

847
02:09:36,743 --> 02:09:39,383
Take the caravan!

848
02:09:41,113 --> 02:09:45,113
Don't feel pity for anyone if
they make any move.

849
02:09:48,084 --> 02:09:49,774
Come on!

